com,"$Detroit players and St. Louis fans thought the game"
com,"was over despite this being only the second out. Fans"
com,"swarmed the field and further play was impossible."
com,"Griggs had apparently struck out and went back to the"
com,"bench. Umpire Evans informed him that he had not struck"
com,"out and Griggs returned to the batter's box where he"
com,"then forced out Jones at 2nd. Probably because Griggs"
com,"was unfamiliar to Tigers and fans, they did not realize"
com,"it was the same batter and not a different batter"
com,"making the third out."
